    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property corresponds to the [`AVCapturePhotoSettings`](avcapturephotosettings.md) property [`isAutoStillImageStabilizationEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautostillimagestabilizationenabled.md).",
      "ko": "이 속성은 [`AVCapturePhotoSettings`](avcapturephotosettings.md)의 [`isAutoStillImageStabilizationEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautostillimagestabilizationenabled.md) 속성에 해당합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5de9385ad1dbf0fb7d24ce0460467b2d3771683255abb29b673bdbba73373c51",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "When this value is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the device automatically applies stabilization in low-light conditions to counteract hand shake.",
      "ko": "이 값이 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)인 경우, 장치는 저조도 조건에서 손떨림 보정을 위해 자동으로 안정화를 적용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ebfb080ed6b7504bc019a76ab02dc1f0498414a0734689220c0a640060e58566",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Automatic stabilization always includes digital image stabilization, and may also include optical lens stabilization, based on the current device.",
      "ko": "자동 안정화에는 항상 디지털 이미지 안정화가 포함되며, 현재 장치에 따라 광학 렌즈 안정화가 포함될 수도 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c27b3d7317accd7812a72cceca8b9fbd65f37dae663bd1d23a785288af57cd72",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "If you specify automatic stabilization when requesting a capture, the device automatically chooses whether to use image stabilization based on the scene contents at the moment of capture.",
      "ko": "A metadata capture output’s [`rectOfInterest`](avcapturemetadataoutput/rectofinterest.md) a [`CGRect`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGRect) value where `{0,0}` represents the top-left of the picture area, and `{1,1}` represents the bottom-right on an unrotated image.",
      "sourceHash": "4c085bf9ce97b772805e2a4dd85e46e5ddc2997e3ddd103e586a771cbc95eecf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Therefore, you don’t know whether the system uses stabilization until right before the moment of capture.",
      "ko": "따라서 캡처 직전 순간이 되어야 시스템에서 안정화 사용 여부를 알 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7e522cfbcc4ccef8ec9833e18f9e44dad65c89e3ab2b7906269d19a0abe2b36c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "When the photo output calls your [`photoOutput(_:willBeginCaptureFor:)`](avcapturephotocapturedelegate/photooutput(_:willbegincapturefor:).md) method (or other delegate methods that occur later in the capture process), you can use this property to determine whether stabilization is active.",
      "ko": "사진 출력이 [`photoOutput(_:willBeginCaptureFor:)`](avcapturephotocapturedelegate/photooutput(_:willbegincapturefor:).md) 메서드(또는 캡처 프로세스의 이후에 호출되는 다른 대리자 메서드)를 호출하면, 이 속성을 사용해 안정화가 활성 상태인지 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4d3371529327e0ff8e737d68985bf8002d6a88c74662ac638be325d40221e667",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
